WEBVTT


00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.533
<i>Plum Pie Contest</i>


00:01:25.664 --> 00:01:27.081
<i>My Dream Villa</i>


00:02:06.677 --> 00:02:08.344
<i>Cake-making Diploma</i>


00:02:26.037 --> 00:02:28.661
Father Baptiste, I've sinned.


00:02:29.163 --> 00:02:34.997
I put roaches in the food of
the Chinks who now run my restaurant.


00:02:35.623 --> 00:02:38.290
Try to understand me, Father.


00:02:38.459 --> 00:02:41.294
And God, try to understand me, too.


00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:44.251
Those Chop Sticks, those Ay-rabs,


00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:47.127
those Negros who invade France...


00:02:47.296 --> 00:02:48.754
They stole our jobs.


00:02:48.922 --> 00:02:50.463
Come now...


00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:53.880
Don't let hate and anger
fill your heart.


00:02:54.048 --> 00:02:56.424
They are always bad counselors.


00:02:56.591 --> 00:02:58.675
I don't mean you, Father.


00:02:58.842 --> 00:03:00.467
You deserve to be white.


00:03:01.634 --> 00:03:04.259
I mean the jigaboo
with my daughter.


00:03:04.426 --> 00:03:06.970
And the Chinks
who took over my restaurant.


00:03:09.928 --> 00:03:11.804
They drove Francis to drink.


00:03:13.473 --> 00:03:15.638
It ended up killing him.


00:03:16.141 --> 00:03:18.264
Your business failed.


00:03:18.433 --> 00:03:21.601
It's not the fault
of those who took it over.


00:03:22.059 --> 00:03:25.935
Don't make all foreigners
the scapegoats of your misfortune.


00:03:27.393 --> 00:03:30.811
Say 10 "Our Fathers"
and 5 "Hail Marys".


00:03:31.313 --> 00:03:34.647
But don't start again, Paulette.


00:03:34.772 --> 00:03:36.481
Don't start again!


00:03:44.568 --> 00:03:47.818
Buy my Périgord cheese!
5 euros for 5!


00:03:47.986 --> 00:03:49.736
Try this, lady.


00:03:51.528 --> 00:03:54.404
You too, sir. 5 euros for 5.


00:03:54.822 --> 00:03:57.904
Go on, sir. Plenty for everyone!


00:03:58.073 --> 00:04:00.240
Taste my cheese...


00:04:02.199 --> 00:04:03.783
Too cheesy!


00:04:41.506 --> 00:04:42.839
Let go of that!


00:04:43.007 --> 00:04:44.298
I saw them first!


00:04:50.843 --> 00:04:52.718
What'll I eat tonight?


00:05:24.563 --> 00:05:26.689
- The phone...
- What phone, Rachid?


00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:29.983
My sister's phone.


00:05:30.192 --> 00:05:31.316
What?


00:05:31.483 --> 00:05:34.984
Your all-inclusive week in Marbella
for her phone.


00:05:36.693 --> 00:05:37.736
Is it working?


00:05:38.486 --> 00:05:40.945
Why wouldn't it be working?


00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:53.826
Home Encyclopedias.


00:05:53.993 --> 00:05:58.453
I can see you're interested
in interior decorating.


00:05:58.703 --> 00:06:01.119
That's lucky as I'm here


00:06:01.538 --> 00:06:02.871
to tell you about...


00:06:03.204 --> 00:06:05.247
our special offers.


00:06:09.749 --> 00:06:11.916
This elevator busts my balls!


00:06:15.668 --> 00:06:16.876
Oh, shit!


00:06:24.631 --> 00:06:26.380
Shouldn't we call Maintenance?


00:06:27.548 --> 00:06:30.714
Are you retarded?
They don't come here anymore!


00:06:36.717 --> 00:06:38.050
My humble respects.


00:06:49.723 --> 00:06:53.099
I hope you'll be proud of me, honey.


00:06:54.099 --> 00:06:56.849
I hope it comes out well.


00:06:57.642 --> 00:06:59.560
Oh, yes, good!


00:07:00.643 --> 00:07:01.643
Not bad...


00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:02.977
1, 2, 3...


00:07:09.147 --> 00:07:11.647
8 PM in Paris,
2 PM in New York.


00:07:11.773 --> 00:07:15.106
Here is today's news
on Sept 11, 2011.


00:07:15.315 --> 00:07:17.732
Tonight, we bring you
a special edition


00:07:17.901 --> 00:07:20.276
on this very emotional date.


00:07:20.444 --> 00:07:22.609
What is the mood today?


00:07:23.153 --> 00:07:24.736
Cheers.


00:07:29.571 --> 00:07:31.154
10 years already...


00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:35.573
If only you'd listened to me


00:07:35.741 --> 00:07:37.949
and drunk a bit less,


00:07:38.117 --> 00:07:40.240
we might've kept our restaurant.


00:07:40.409 --> 00:07:43.576
It says "September 2001"
on the walls of New York...


00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:46.243
10 years
since the World Trade Center...


00:07:46.744 --> 00:07:48.119
3,000 dead...


00:07:48.329 --> 00:07:49.454
A sad date...


00:07:49.621 --> 00:07:50.787
10 years ago...


00:07:52.539 --> 00:07:54.537
Are they doing it on purpose?


00:08:04.752 --> 00:08:07.002
Why aren't they out working?


00:08:08.127 --> 00:08:12.044
The 35-hour week,
retirement at 60 - what a joke!


00:08:17.174 --> 00:08:18.797
Hello, Miss.


00:08:19.715 --> 00:08:22.924
I didn't know your husband
was my wife's neighbor.


00:08:24.718 --> 00:08:26.050
"Sept 11, 2001."


00:08:26.719 --> 00:08:28.301
Did he die in the Towers?


00:08:30.553 --> 00:08:33.970
Did your wife die,
'cause of an April Fool's trick?


00:08:37.012 --> 00:08:39.138
Denise
Died April 1, 2004


00:08:47.519 --> 00:08:50.727
Lazy bastards!
Why not go out begging?


00:09:08.151 --> 00:09:09.985
Jérémy, wait!


00:09:10.152 --> 00:09:12.361
I've walked in shit! Oh, fuck!


00:09:15.654 --> 00:09:17.071
Fuckin' pain!


00:09:23.782 --> 00:09:26.492
Jérémy,
something's moving on its own.


00:09:27.533 --> 00:09:29.576
You smoke too much!


00:09:32.036 --> 00:09:33.869
What's he up to?


00:09:34.036 --> 00:09:35.286
There he is.


00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:39.372
Good evening, gentlemen.
Tollbooth!


00:09:40.706 --> 00:09:42.039
It's all there.


00:09:42.206 --> 00:09:43.874
We gotta check.


00:09:44.291 --> 00:09:45.540
That's business.


00:09:45.708 --> 00:09:48.375
Francis,
I've never seen so much cash.


00:09:48.833 --> 00:09:49.833
What is this?


00:09:50.001 --> 00:09:52.960
Thank you, young man.
Have a great evening.


00:09:53.128 --> 00:09:54.086
You too.


00:09:54.293 --> 00:09:55.461
Goodbye.


00:10:01.505 --> 00:10:02.714
Hi, Mom.


00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:03.964
Say hello, Léo.


00:10:04.131 --> 00:10:04.796
Hello.


00:10:04.965 --> 00:10:06.548
- Hello who?
- Grandma.


00:10:06.716 --> 00:10:07.840
Don't call me that.


00:10:08.008 --> 00:10:09.340
What, then?


00:10:09.592 --> 00:10:11.467
He shouldn't call me anything.


00:10:13.387 --> 00:10:14.593
When'll you be back?


00:10:14.762 --> 00:10:15.885
I'm working late...


00:10:16.301 --> 00:10:17.301
When?


00:10:18.013 --> 00:10:19.511
Around 5.


00:10:24.223 --> 00:10:25.472
That all there is?


00:10:25.641 --> 00:10:28.057
If you're not happy, don't eat it.


00:10:30.724 --> 00:10:32.849
I'd like a TV like that.


00:10:33.018 --> 00:10:34.183
What kind?


00:10:39.311 --> 00:10:41.478
Why don't you like me?


00:10:42.938 --> 00:10:44.646
'Cause you're black.


00:10:49.149 --> 00:10:51.899
You're Debbie,
the new recruit, right?


00:10:52.233 --> 00:10:54.734
Yes. You can call me Deb.


00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:58.567
OK, what else?


00:11:02.362 --> 00:11:03.569
No new leads.


00:11:03.738 --> 00:11:05.821
Look at the DNA!


00:11:05.947 --> 00:11:08.571
Really, Francis,
this new cop is so dumb!


00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:12.989
It's not difficult. DNA's everywhere,
even on butt hair!


00:11:19.826 --> 00:11:21.076
I'm not home!


00:11:21.245 --> 00:11:22.994
Paulette, let me in.


00:11:23.163 --> 00:11:24.244
No!


00:11:25.663 --> 00:11:28.038
My mother-in-law's a bit strange.


00:11:28.414 --> 00:11:29.038
What?


00:11:29.205 --> 00:11:30.496
Lt. Marchal.


00:11:30.915 --> 00:11:34.457
We have some questions
about drug trafficking.


00:11:36.084 --> 00:11:37.501
Hi, Paulette.


00:11:37.668 --> 00:11:41.208
You use blacks
to arrest drug traffickers now?


00:11:42.543 --> 00:11:45.836
Don't mind her,
she's always like that.


00:11:46.213 --> 00:11:48.255
We're on an investigation.


00:11:48.464 --> 00:11:50.589
I thought you could help us.


00:11:50.882 --> 00:11:52.882
We've arrested a kid from here.


00:11:53.383 --> 00:11:56.132
Jérémy - heard of him?


00:12:03.094 --> 00:12:04.761
Thank you, but...


00:12:05.554 --> 00:12:06.429
Don't want any?


00:12:06.596 --> 00:12:08.471
No, I'm used to it.


00:12:08.971 --> 00:12:11.597
So, you've arrested Jérémy?


00:12:11.889 --> 00:12:13.056
For trafficking.


00:12:13.724 --> 00:12:14.972
Trafficking?


00:12:15.141 --> 00:12:16.348
Trafficking what?


00:12:17.059 --> 00:12:17.933
Cannabis.


00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:20.350
Much money in it?


00:12:20.518 --> 00:12:25.102
Well, 400 to 500,000 euros
a year, yes.


00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:28.060
What? That little shit,
500 grand a year!


00:12:28.229 --> 00:12:29.646
He's just a dealer.


00:12:29.814 --> 00:12:31.771
We're after the big boss.


00:12:33.065 --> 00:12:34.273
A guy called Vito.


00:12:52.447 --> 00:12:53.280
Hello, Paulette.


00:12:53.989 --> 00:12:55.697
Coming to play cards?


00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.783
That's where it all happens.


00:13:07.036 --> 00:13:09.244
Leave me alone
with your damn cards!


00:13:15.706 --> 00:13:16.872
Mrs Courtine,


00:13:17.165 --> 00:13:19.082
I'm appointed by the Court


00:13:19.249 --> 00:13:21.415
to seize your belongings...


00:13:21.873 --> 00:13:22.666
Fuck you!


00:13:24.875 --> 00:13:25.499
Here.


00:13:27.877 --> 00:13:30.711
A year's outstanding payments
on a loan,


00:13:30.878 --> 00:13:34.878
2 years' unpaid
gas and electricity bills,


00:13:35.047 --> 00:13:37.963
on your rent and service charges.


00:13:38.674 --> 00:13:40.047
You're not solvent,


00:13:40.215 --> 00:13:42.214
so I'm seizing your belongings.


00:13:42.425 --> 00:13:44.758
You can't!
I'm on a minimum pension.


00:13:45.093 --> 00:13:46.800
So, we have...


00:13:47.719 --> 00:13:49.883
2 reproduction armchairs,


00:13:50.552 --> 00:13:52.051
1 standard lamp...


00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:54.386
Not my lamp!


00:13:54.846 --> 00:13:58.055
1 TV, brand: Radiola.


00:13:58.805 --> 00:14:00.514
Not my TV!


00:14:00.683 --> 00:14:02.598
A dresser, style:


00:14:02.764 --> 00:14:05.224
country or rustic.


00:14:06.726 --> 00:14:07.516
Fuckers!


00:14:07.684 --> 00:14:11.268
If you have a complaint to lodge,
phone the Court.


00:14:12.144 --> 00:14:14.895
Their number
is on the paper I gave you.


00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:32.400
To pay your bill, say "Pay".


00:14:32.568 --> 00:14:34.151
It worked just now.


00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:37.861
Please repeat.
I didn't understand you.


00:14:51.494 --> 00:14:53.535
- Going out tonight?
- To a party.


00:14:54.036 --> 00:14:56.203
Call the guys up, then.


00:14:57.079 --> 00:14:59.328
- Where is it?
- In Paris.


00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:19.795
What d'ya want, Grandma?


00:15:21.296 --> 00:15:22.880
I want to see the boss.


00:15:25.633 --> 00:15:26.715
Who?


00:15:26.883 --> 00:15:28.213
Vito!


00:15:31.967 --> 00:15:33.633
What d'ya say?


00:15:33.926 --> 00:15:35.260
Get off me, jigaboo!


00:15:35.469 --> 00:15:37.636
Say that again.


00:15:37.802 --> 00:15:39.177
Get off her!


00:15:42.428 --> 00:15:43.762
What d'ya want?


00:15:43.929 --> 00:15:45.429
To talk to Mr Vito.


00:15:46.055 --> 00:15:47.139
That's me.


00:15:48.348 --> 00:15:49.931
Who is it?


00:15:52.851 --> 00:15:56.349
Mr Vito, I know what you do.
I want in.


00:15:57.895 --> 00:15:59.143
What do I do?


00:16:03.521 --> 00:16:04.772
I want to sell drugs.


00:16:10.149 --> 00:16:12.023
This is no old people's club!


00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:15.775
I ran a successful business
for 35 years.


00:16:17.276 --> 00:16:19.609
Go to bed, Grandma, it's late.


00:16:19.777 --> 00:16:21.736
And I don't know what you mean.


00:16:37.535 --> 00:16:39.575
We thought you weren't coming.


00:16:40.242 --> 00:16:42.159
Hello, my darling!


00:16:44.036 --> 00:16:45.536
- Look!
- No!


00:16:45.913 --> 00:16:47.619
He'll need a dentist.


00:16:47.914 --> 00:16:51.080
I'm with Maria,
you're with Renée.


00:16:51.998 --> 00:16:54.873
Renée?
She doesn't know her own name!


00:16:56.124 --> 00:16:57.916
What? It's true, isn't it?


00:16:58.043 --> 00:17:00.666
Yes, but we take it in turns.


00:17:02.545 --> 00:17:03.251
Hi, Walter!


00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.002
Ladies!


00:17:07.129 --> 00:17:08.335
That's all we needed!


00:17:08.546 --> 00:17:10.087
You're lovelier everyday.


00:17:12.548 --> 00:17:13.338
Mr Walter!


00:17:14.048 --> 00:17:15.631
It's true.


00:17:16.841 --> 00:17:19.216
OK, whose turn is it?


00:17:19.591 --> 00:17:23.091
Pass.


00:17:25.843 --> 00:17:28.344
Are you gonna be long?


00:17:28.553 --> 00:17:30.095
Where's Francis?


00:17:32.596 --> 00:17:34.056
Renée, just play.


00:17:34.348 --> 00:17:37.222
Remember,
we played at the restaurant?


00:17:40.474 --> 00:17:43.976
She should be put out of her misery.
What a pain.


00:17:46.476 --> 00:17:48.351
Go on, play, Alzheimer!


00:18:09.861 --> 00:18:11.820
Ousmane, Lil' Yves, that way!


00:18:11.988 --> 00:18:13.237
Hurry up!


00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:20.656
Now what?


00:18:20.824 --> 00:18:23.533
Peek-a-boo!
It's Grandma Paulette!


00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:26.284
Here's something you lost!


00:18:26.536 --> 00:18:28.535
You fucker!


00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:32.661
Go on, whack that mutha!


00:18:32.829 --> 00:18:34.329
Square, triangle!


00:18:37.372 --> 00:18:38.622
Where d'ya get that?


00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:39.997
In a trashcan.


00:18:41.123 --> 00:18:41.957
What?


00:18:43.042 --> 00:18:44.667
Listen, Mr Vito,


00:18:44.834 --> 00:18:47.917
I know that Jérémy and his pal
sell drugs.


00:18:48.042 --> 00:18:49.043
I saw them.


00:18:49.418 --> 00:18:52.627
I promise I'll keep quiet
if I can work for you.


00:18:52.795 --> 00:18:54.294
I can't afford to eat.


00:18:54.504 --> 00:18:56.629
I worked my whole life.


00:18:56.797 --> 00:18:59.005
She lives in Block Victor Hugo.


00:18:59.256 --> 00:19:02.590
There's a job going
now that Jérémy's in jail.


00:19:02.757 --> 00:19:04.631
And the force are after you.


00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:05.674
The what?


00:19:06.424 --> 00:19:07.799
The cops.


00:19:08.176 --> 00:19:09.676
Who'll suspect me?


00:19:15.011 --> 00:19:15.885
Listen...


00:19:16.011 --> 00:19:17.095
Paulette.


00:19:19.513 --> 00:19:21.848
A little old lady is a first for me.


00:19:33.269 --> 00:19:34.643
It may not be so dumb.


00:19:35.728 --> 00:19:37.728
I'll give you a trial run.
90-10.


00:19:37.895 --> 00:19:39.020
90% for me,


00:19:39.646 --> 00:19:40.731
10% for you.


00:19:42.189 --> 00:19:43.980
You have a deal.


00:19:45.274 --> 00:19:46.814
Know what to do?


00:19:48.149 --> 00:19:50.358
5-gram bars.
Want me to show you?


00:19:50.568 --> 00:19:52.943
No. What do you think I am?


00:19:57.195 --> 00:19:58.069
What the fuck?


00:19:58.237 --> 00:19:59.987
What're you doing?


00:20:00.112 --> 00:20:02.571
Hey, I'm a trailblazer!


00:20:14.826 --> 00:20:16.534
Keep the damn noise down!


00:20:34.709 --> 00:20:36.751
What does this shit sell for?


00:20:36.918 --> 00:20:38.752
Francis, do you know?


00:20:47.922 --> 00:20:50.089
Ousmane, you have a visitor.


00:20:52.259 --> 00:20:53.591
What's happened?


00:20:53.759 --> 00:20:55.299
Everything's fine.


00:20:55.926 --> 00:20:57.010
Why are you here?


00:20:57.136 --> 00:20:58.551
I came to say hello.


00:21:00.053 --> 00:21:02.345
- So, Osama...
- Ousmane.


00:21:02.554 --> 00:21:04.888
How about showing me around?


00:21:05.054 --> 00:21:06.555
I've never been in here.


00:21:07.722 --> 00:21:08.971
The thing is...


00:21:09.097 --> 00:21:11.098
Where do you put the seizures?


00:21:12.975 --> 00:21:14.475
You know...


00:21:14.892 --> 00:21:16.642
Counterfeit cigarettes, dope...


00:21:18.435 --> 00:21:19.727
Show me,


00:21:19.896 --> 00:21:21.602
dear little Ousmene.


00:21:32.691 --> 00:21:33.899
100 kilos!


00:21:34.276 --> 00:21:36.107
What's that worth?


00:21:36.275 --> 00:21:37.900
200 to 250,000 euros.


00:21:38.067 --> 00:21:38.983
That much!


00:21:39.109 --> 00:21:40.817
It's our biggest haul.


00:21:43.069 --> 00:21:44.236
And this?


00:21:44.945 --> 00:21:48.405
5 kilos. 10,000 euros.
Double that on the street.


00:21:48.613 --> 00:21:51.071
What's a gram worth, then?


00:22:03.912 --> 00:22:05.786
Where can I find some hashish?


00:22:06.953 --> 00:22:07.827
What?


00:22:07.996 --> 00:22:09.370
Hashish.


00:22:10.955 --> 00:22:12.371
- Hash!
- OK, I get it.


00:22:15.082 --> 00:22:16.456
You get stoned?


00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:18.332
What?


00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:21.749
Nothing.
By the station in the underpass.


00:22:22.918 --> 00:22:26.002
- It's not good at your age.
- Sit on this!


00:23:00.724 --> 00:23:02.140
Want some dope?


00:23:02.309 --> 00:23:03.767
Some what?


00:23:17.647 --> 00:23:19.733
Do you want some drugs?


00:23:20.180 --> 00:23:22.730
Hashish!


00:23:38.072 --> 00:23:39.363
You work for the cops?


00:23:41.699 --> 00:23:43.156
The drug squad - bravo!


00:23:43.324 --> 00:23:46.033
No, I sell drugs.


00:23:57.539 --> 00:24:00.456
Whatcha doin', loser? You dealin'?


00:24:00.664 --> 00:24:02.998
Who are you to sell shit to an oldie?


00:24:03.123 --> 00:24:03.915
I'm not.


00:24:04.083 --> 00:24:06.791
Go on, beat it! Scram!


00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:08.876
If I see you dealin' here,


00:24:09.043 --> 00:24:10.751
I'll kick your head in!


00:24:11.128 --> 00:24:12.750
Beat it!


00:24:22.881 --> 00:24:24.340
How much for a bar?


00:24:24.799 --> 00:24:26.466
Well, 25 euros.


00:24:26.673 --> 00:24:28.923
5 grams. I weighed it myself.


00:24:29.093 --> 00:24:30.675
I only have 20.


00:24:31.344 --> 00:24:32.968
Alright.


00:24:34.678 --> 00:24:35.802
Thanks!


00:24:39.638 --> 00:24:40.762
You here often?


00:24:40.929 --> 00:24:44.472
I'd rather buy from you
than those kids who sell me crap.


00:24:44.974 --> 00:24:48.681
And with you, I can be sure
you don't work for the police.


00:24:49.892 --> 00:24:51.559
What an idiot!


00:24:51.893 --> 00:24:54.393
- I hope it's not cut with tires.
- Tires?


00:24:54.560 --> 00:24:57.894
Don't worry. If it's good stuff,
I'll be coming back.


00:25:11.441 --> 00:25:12.816
Already?


00:25:17.111 --> 00:25:18.861
- It's all there.
- Sure?


00:25:20.487 --> 00:25:21.778
Go get the gear!


00:25:31.408 --> 00:25:33.241
- 10%, right?
- That's right.


00:25:33.951 --> 00:25:36.034
Thank you, Mr Vito.


00:25:42.245 --> 00:25:43.579
There.


00:26:08.505 --> 00:26:11.006
What is it, boy?
What is it, Delinquent?


00:26:20.843 --> 00:26:22.342
Go on, Delinquent.


00:26:25.220 --> 00:26:26.720
Fetch.


00:26:27.304 --> 00:26:28.554
Scram, you hound!


00:26:28.764 --> 00:26:30.137
Fetch!


00:26:30.555 --> 00:26:31.972
Good boy!


00:26:34.141 --> 00:26:35.723
Get off me!


00:26:35.891 --> 00:26:37.723
Keep your mangy dog back!


00:26:37.892 --> 00:26:39.224
Scram!


00:26:40.684 --> 00:26:43.184
Your dog knocked the lady over!


00:26:43.311 --> 00:26:46.436
- He's on a trail.
- He's on my mother-in-law.


00:26:49.604 --> 00:26:50.853
No, I'll carry it.


00:26:51.022 --> 00:26:52.438
I'll manage.


00:26:52.605 --> 00:26:54.397
No, I insist.


00:26:56.525 --> 00:26:57.941
It's heavy.


00:26:58.484 --> 00:27:00.441
What's in it?


00:27:02.610 --> 00:27:03.484
Drugs.


00:27:04.404 --> 00:27:05.778
Drugs?!


00:27:06.738 --> 00:27:08.154
No, it's OK.


00:27:08.404 --> 00:27:09.612
That's a good one!


00:27:10.239 --> 00:27:13.197
I didn't know you could be so funny.


00:27:14.574 --> 00:27:15.907
Well, thanks.


00:27:16.074 --> 00:27:19.991
I bet the elevator's out of order.
I'll take it upstairs.


00:27:30.955 --> 00:27:32.202
Thanks a lot.


00:27:37.207 --> 00:27:39.415
You know, I'm really pleased...


00:27:40.458 --> 00:27:43.501
we can talk
and things are better between us.


00:27:43.710 --> 00:27:46.251
You've stopped calling me Darkie.


00:27:56.881 --> 00:27:59.089
- Tell me something.
- Yes?


00:27:59.215 --> 00:28:01.714
What does a cannabis dealer make?


00:28:20.891 --> 00:28:22.598
Paulette, open up!


00:28:23.267 --> 00:28:24.557
Oh, shit!


00:28:24.768 --> 00:28:26.934
If you don't open this door...


00:28:27.268 --> 00:28:29.351
Where did you get to?


00:28:29.518 --> 00:28:31.893
We keep calling you,
you never answer.


00:28:32.811 --> 00:28:36.229
You don't even come to play cards.


00:28:36.395 --> 00:28:38.729
Are you redecorating?


00:28:44.357 --> 00:28:47.566
It smells good.
It smells really good!


00:28:48.525 --> 00:28:49.482
No entry!


00:28:50.027 --> 00:28:51.234
What're you hiding?


00:28:55.154 --> 00:28:56.445
Someone's in there.


00:28:56.821 --> 00:28:57.861
Who?


00:28:58.030 --> 00:28:58.903
A man.


00:29:00.030 --> 00:29:00.904
Let's see.


00:29:01.239 --> 00:29:02.780
Not possible.


00:29:02.949 --> 00:29:04.614
- Is he...?
- Naked.


00:29:04.824 --> 00:29:05.741
Stark naked?


00:29:06.659 --> 00:29:08.240
I'll tell you later.


00:29:12.827 --> 00:29:14.243
Who is it?


00:29:14.369 --> 00:29:15.328
The janitor?


00:29:15.494 --> 00:29:17.161
No, she can't stand him.


00:29:17.286 --> 00:29:18.454
Not Father Baptiste?


00:29:18.621 --> 00:29:20.621
No. And he's black.


00:29:20.831 --> 00:29:22.580
Doing it in the kitchen!


00:29:22.789 --> 00:29:24.496
It must be very physical.


00:29:24.664 --> 00:29:26.289
- Passionate.
- Yes.


00:29:28.166 --> 00:29:29.791
Walter!


00:29:30.124 --> 00:29:31.334
No...


00:29:35.128 --> 00:29:36.669
What is she doing here?


00:29:39.337 --> 00:29:40.752
1 euro a can!


00:29:42.421 --> 00:29:43.963
A can of tuna, 1 euro.


00:29:44.130 --> 00:29:45.504
2 steaks, 1 euro!


00:29:51.134 --> 00:29:53.090
Shit, Afghan, ganja!


00:29:53.259 --> 00:29:54.801
- Is it good?
- Yeah.


00:29:54.967 --> 00:29:55.843
OK.


00:29:56.385 --> 00:29:57.510
Got any money?


00:29:58.554 --> 00:29:59.428
Beat it!


00:30:06.350 --> 00:30:07.388
You ripped me off.


00:30:08.099 --> 00:30:09.223
You owe me 20.


00:30:10.017 --> 00:30:11.557
Here. See you.


00:30:14.767 --> 00:30:16.893
Hi. Got any more?


00:30:17.061 --> 00:30:19.353
5 bars for the price of 4.
A bargain.


00:30:21.187 --> 00:30:22.519
Here you are.


00:30:24.188 --> 00:30:25.896
I don't touch that.


00:30:28.774 --> 00:30:30.482
Top-quality gear.


00:30:45.947 --> 00:30:48.489
When will you reconnect the phone?


00:30:48.656 --> 00:30:50.654
Tomorrow or the day after...


00:30:50.866 --> 00:30:51.781
Not today?


00:30:52.242 --> 00:30:53.532
This has to clear.


00:30:54.868 --> 00:30:56.909
Fucking trade unionist!


00:31:12.916 --> 00:31:14.291
Who's this?


00:31:14.458 --> 00:31:15.790
Come now, Renée,


00:31:15.959 --> 00:31:17.207
it's Paulette.


00:31:19.292 --> 00:31:20.667
I didn't recognize you.


00:31:21.085 --> 00:31:23.085
What's that coat?


00:31:23.252 --> 00:31:24.502
It's leather.


00:31:25.045 --> 00:31:26.712
The bag's new, too.


00:31:26.920 --> 00:31:28.420
From that guy of yours?


00:31:28.590 --> 00:31:29.337
Who?


00:31:29.881 --> 00:31:31.339
You know.


00:31:31.506 --> 00:31:32.880
In the kitchen.


00:31:33.048 --> 00:31:35.007
Drop it. You're like the pigs.


00:31:35.590 --> 00:31:37.674
- The what?
- "Pigs".


00:31:46.261 --> 00:31:48.052
My humble respects, Miss.


00:31:48.928 --> 00:31:50.638
You look ravishing!


00:31:50.846 --> 00:31:52.054
- It's him.
- Old fool!


00:31:52.931 --> 00:31:54.971
No, it's not him.


00:31:55.141 --> 00:31:58.474
- Who, then?
- A youngster. Listen to her talk.


00:31:59.143 --> 00:32:01.599
- Where are you going?
- Tell us.


00:32:01.808 --> 00:32:03.559
Later. Not now.


00:32:08.603 --> 00:32:10.312
The body of Christ...


00:32:16.897 --> 00:32:19.230
Father Baptiste, I've sinned.


00:32:19.358 --> 00:32:22.483
You put roaches
in your neighbor's food?


00:32:22.651 --> 00:32:24.193
Worse than that.


00:32:26.652 --> 00:32:27.943
The sin of lust?


00:32:28.528 --> 00:32:31.318
No! Worse than that.


00:32:32.945 --> 00:32:34.738
What have you done?


00:32:36.865 --> 00:32:38.572
I sold drugs.


00:32:39.033 --> 00:32:40.533
What?


00:32:41.199 --> 00:32:42.657
Hash, ganja...


00:32:42.991 --> 00:32:45.699
Paulette, you know it's not allowed!


00:32:45.910 --> 00:32:48.911
I know it's wrong, very wrong.


00:32:49.328 --> 00:32:52.495
A moment of distraction.
Don't do it again.


00:32:54.747 --> 00:32:58.747
I earn money, I meet people...


00:32:58.957 --> 00:33:02.457
I can pay off my debts,
I can buy myself nice things...


00:33:03.376 --> 00:33:05.333
I feel as excited


00:33:05.502 --> 00:33:08.168
as when we had the restaurant.


00:33:08.586 --> 00:33:10.461
I want to make a donation.


00:33:10.628 --> 00:33:13.171
I want God to profit from it.


00:33:14.255 --> 00:33:17.755
Put it in the box.
I want nothing to do with it.


00:33:17.963 --> 00:33:19.464
An Ay-rab would steal it!


00:33:20.090 --> 00:33:22.632
No, thanks!
I'd rather give it to you.


00:33:23.842 --> 00:33:25.133
What?


00:33:25.342 --> 00:33:29.009
The collection at Mass
won't pay for the new roof.


00:33:30.219 --> 00:33:31.510
Go on!


00:33:32.888 --> 00:33:34.218
Hallelujah!


00:33:45.224 --> 00:33:46.391
It's Granny Junkie!


00:33:46.559 --> 00:33:48.349
Go sell your shit!


00:33:48.517 --> 00:33:50.977
Don't go, Granny.
You got good gear.


00:33:51.144 --> 00:33:53.312
Whatcha got in your bag?


00:33:56.020 --> 00:33:57.978
That's your name:
Granny Junkie!


00:33:58.313 --> 00:33:59.353
Give me that.


00:34:02.023 --> 00:34:04.106
Not so proud now, you old bitch?


00:34:04.274 --> 00:34:05.566
How dare you?


00:34:05.982 --> 00:34:07.441
You're white!


00:34:07.608 --> 00:34:08.315
Oh, yeah?


00:34:09.233 --> 00:34:10.316
Are you nuts?


00:34:10.442 --> 00:34:11.775
Shut your face!


00:34:11.985 --> 00:34:14.277
What? You said you'd just scare her.


00:34:14.403 --> 00:34:15.859
She's like my granny.


00:34:16.029 --> 00:34:19.111
She takes clients off us
on our turf.


00:34:19.280 --> 00:34:21.322
Get outta here! Time to retire!


00:34:21.448 --> 00:34:23.362
Fuck off to the countryside!


00:34:23.656 --> 00:34:24.947
We don't need you.


00:34:25.324 --> 00:34:26.530
If I see you again,


00:34:26.699 --> 00:34:28.865
I'll rip your fuckin' head off!


00:34:29.492 --> 00:34:30.741
Stop it!


00:34:31.368 --> 00:34:32.702
You've gone crazy!


00:34:43.497 --> 00:34:45.789
What'll I tell Vito?


00:34:46.248 --> 00:34:49.457
Those little shits stole
half my takings.


00:35:06.797 --> 00:35:08.590
A 5-gram bar...


00:35:09.423 --> 00:35:11.048
A bit of tire...


00:35:24.262 --> 00:35:25.929
Not enough tire.


00:35:32.600 --> 00:35:34.431
What's happened?


00:35:34.683 --> 00:35:36.390
Why wear Dad's sunglasses?


00:35:37.725 --> 00:35:39.559
I have to work overtime.


00:35:40.103 --> 00:35:41.393
I won't keep him.


00:35:41.520 --> 00:35:42.185
You must...


00:35:42.354 --> 00:35:44.978
You chose to have a black bastard!


00:35:57.024 --> 00:35:58.275
You be quiet!


00:35:58.901 --> 00:36:00.318
Where's the TV?


00:36:00.444 --> 00:36:01.985
Keep your mouth shut!


00:36:05.904 --> 00:36:09.197
"How to survive a heatwave..."


00:36:10.280 --> 00:36:12.322
It stinks!


00:36:15.366 --> 00:36:16.533
It'll never work.


00:36:21.577 --> 00:36:22.494
What?


00:36:22.953 --> 00:36:24.953
Please open the door, Grandma.


00:36:25.121 --> 00:36:26.161
No!


00:36:27.080 --> 00:36:28.329
What's the smell?


00:36:28.455 --> 00:36:30.079
I've baked a cake.


00:36:30.413 --> 00:36:31.954
Can I have some?


00:36:32.123 --> 00:36:33.039
No!


00:37:09.389 --> 00:37:10.470
Léo?


00:37:18.765 --> 00:37:20.016
Is this Mom?


00:37:20.183 --> 00:37:22.433
You look like you're having fun.


00:37:22.601 --> 00:37:24.642
Leave that, you little shit!


00:37:24.810 --> 00:37:26.144
What did I do?


00:37:26.310 --> 00:37:27.684
You muckraker!


00:37:27.852 --> 00:37:29.435
I didn't do anything!


00:37:36.774 --> 00:37:39.149
Open up or you'll be for it!


00:37:40.773 --> 00:37:42.440
What're you doing?


00:37:45.484 --> 00:37:48.192
Léo, let me in.


00:37:51.238 --> 00:37:53.571
Please, kid... Honey...


00:37:54.322 --> 00:37:55.738
You're mean!


00:37:57.156 --> 00:38:00.488
I was mean,
but I won't be mean again.


00:38:04.242 --> 00:38:05.409
Come on...


00:38:06.618 --> 00:38:10.035
My little Léo,
please let me in.


00:38:10.576 --> 00:38:13.661
I was wrong to get upset.
I shouldn't have.


00:38:14.245 --> 00:38:15.827
I'm sorry.


00:38:29.001 --> 00:38:31.083
- Did you touch this?
- What?


00:38:33.586 --> 00:38:35.377
Don't tell your mother.


00:38:35.503 --> 00:38:36.753
What's in that box?


00:38:43.839 --> 00:38:48.257
If you like, I'll give you
a big slice of chocolate cake,


00:38:48.759 --> 00:38:51.801
because you've been good.


00:38:52.009 --> 00:38:54.342
I don't want any.
I'm gonna tell Mom.


00:38:56.011 --> 00:38:58.886
Sweetie, I'd like us
to get to know one another,


00:39:00.179 --> 00:39:01.555
see more of each other.


00:39:01.723 --> 00:39:03.057
I may tease you,


00:39:03.224 --> 00:39:04.515
'cause you're black.


00:39:05.267 --> 00:39:07.599
I'd have preferred you to be white.


00:39:08.267 --> 00:39:09.558
That's the way it is.


00:39:10.100 --> 00:39:12.560
But deep down, I like you.


00:39:12.726 --> 00:39:15.228
You're a liar. I'll tell Mom!


00:39:16.104 --> 00:39:18.354
Just you wait n' see!


00:39:29.108 --> 00:39:30.443
Grandma!


00:39:33.277 --> 00:39:35.484
Quick... Water...


00:40:07.997 --> 00:40:10.373
Why are you mean to everyone?


00:40:10.499 --> 00:40:12.582
Why don't you like anyone?


00:40:17.501 --> 00:40:20.043
You saved my life, jigaboo.


00:40:22.337 --> 00:40:25.129
'Course I did, you're my grandma.


00:40:35.217 --> 00:40:37.051
Sorry I'm late.


00:40:37.384 --> 00:40:39.092
My battery was dead...


00:40:39.261 --> 00:40:40.177
That's OK.


00:40:42.512 --> 00:40:44.095
Was she mean to you?


00:40:44.638 --> 00:40:45.595
Did she hit you?


00:40:45.762 --> 00:40:47.637
No. Come on.


00:40:49.388 --> 00:40:50.471
You're dolled up.


00:40:51.765 --> 00:40:52.889
Expecting someone?


00:40:56.058 --> 00:40:57.266
What's wrong?


00:40:57.434 --> 00:40:58.725
It tastes funny.


00:40:58.894 --> 00:41:01.267
Salt, pepper...


00:41:02.810 --> 00:41:04.227
Sugar...


00:41:04.395 --> 00:41:07.061
And something I can't identify.


00:41:07.230 --> 00:41:08.437
What?


00:41:09.105 --> 00:41:10.855
Tastes like cinnamon.


00:41:11.189 --> 00:41:12.898
You put cinnamon in it.


00:41:14.107 --> 00:41:18.524
With less sugar, salt, and pepper,
it'd taste different.


00:41:19.568 --> 00:41:21.192
It's not bad.


00:41:21.861 --> 00:41:23.318
I'll have another piece.


00:41:26.113 --> 00:41:27.443
Japanese restaurant?


00:41:27.569 --> 00:41:29.069
Aren't you hungry?


00:41:29.238 --> 00:41:30.363
4 pizzas.


00:41:30.529 --> 00:41:32.070
Japs don't do pizzas.


00:41:32.615 --> 00:41:36.155
They do raw fish ones!
Noodle pizza!


00:41:36.324 --> 00:41:37.616
What's so funny?


00:41:38.657 --> 00:41:41.492
Tell us what you put in the cake.


00:41:42.201 --> 00:41:43.075
What is it?


00:41:43.535 --> 00:41:44.743
It's him.


00:41:47.370 --> 00:41:48.285
Mr Walter?


00:41:48.453 --> 00:41:49.620
Speaking.


00:41:49.787 --> 00:41:52.287
I'm on fire. I want you so much!


00:41:53.498 --> 00:41:54.248
Stop it.


00:41:54.414 --> 00:41:55.539
Who is this?


00:41:55.830 --> 00:41:58.413
Come on... I'm waiting!


00:42:00.790 --> 00:42:02.250
Don't mess around.


00:42:03.627 --> 00:42:04.835
Wait, wait.


00:42:06.961 --> 00:42:08.378
Miss Paulette!


00:42:08.796 --> 00:42:10.796
It's me, Walter!


00:42:26.802 --> 00:42:27.593
Really!


00:42:32.388 --> 00:42:34.138
Francis, thanks to jigaboo,


00:42:34.680 --> 00:42:37.139
I think I have the solution.


00:43:29.368 --> 00:43:31.910
Agnès tried to reach you.
She was worried.


00:43:32.827 --> 00:43:34.119
What's wrong?


00:43:35.369 --> 00:43:36.620
Are you OK?


00:43:36.787 --> 00:43:38.536
I just woke up, that's all.


00:43:39.579 --> 00:43:40.829
It's 2 PM.


00:43:41.665 --> 00:43:44.707
Really? Thank you, Ousmana.


00:43:45.625 --> 00:43:46.791
How do you know her?


00:43:46.958 --> 00:43:49.291
She said you had a tiny dick.


00:43:49.875 --> 00:43:52.958
- What?
- You got nothing in your pants.


00:43:53.170 --> 00:43:55.126
Where are you going?


00:43:55.295 --> 00:43:56.502
Didn't you get it?


00:43:56.879 --> 00:43:59.629
- I'm selling cakes.
- Are they good?


00:44:00.212 --> 00:44:02.422
- Paws off!
- Don't touch me!


00:44:02.589 --> 00:44:04.963
- Stop it, Zak.
- Beat it, you!


00:44:05.173 --> 00:44:07.506
You diss us and take our business.


00:44:08.216 --> 00:44:10.883
Your business is selling cakes now?


00:44:11.091 --> 00:44:12.927
Missy is a baker!


00:44:14.093 --> 00:44:16.843
- Pick on someone your own size!
- She your gran?


00:44:17.012 --> 00:44:18.218
Don't diss my gran.


00:44:18.387 --> 00:44:21.262
Whatever!
Shut your mouth, camel face!


00:44:22.346 --> 00:44:25.263
Yeah, very funny, you clowns!


00:44:25.889 --> 00:44:27.721
Tasty Afghan cookies!


00:44:27.891 --> 00:44:29.598
Space cakes!


00:44:29.724 --> 00:44:31.932
Afghan cookies! Space cakes!


00:44:34.018 --> 00:44:35.183
Afghan cookies!


00:44:35.350 --> 00:44:36.141
Any dope?


00:44:36.769 --> 00:44:38.561
No, I bake cakes now.


00:44:38.687 --> 00:44:40.560
Cakes aren't my thing.


00:44:40.686 --> 00:44:41.853
Afghan cookies!


00:44:42.020 --> 00:44:44.229
As it's you, I'll give it a try.


00:44:44.397 --> 00:44:46.479
I'll have one. How much?


00:44:46.605 --> 00:44:47.478
20.


00:44:47.606 --> 00:44:49.022
That's a lot.


00:44:49.231 --> 00:44:51.648
There's the labor. And it's organic.


00:44:54.983 --> 00:44:56.275
Space cakes.


00:44:56.443 --> 00:44:57.275
How much?


00:44:57.445 --> 00:44:58.734
- 20.
- 20?!


00:44:58.904 --> 00:45:00.443
Can we sample them?


00:45:01.861 --> 00:45:03.778
No, you can't sample 'em.


00:45:06.906 --> 00:45:07.780
5,000.


00:45:13.659 --> 00:45:16.368
It's the 3rd time this week.


00:45:16.534 --> 00:45:18.784
I'm a born businesswoman.


00:45:18.953 --> 00:45:20.202
Talking of which,


00:45:20.661 --> 00:45:22.579
I hear that dealers get


00:45:22.705 --> 00:45:25.287
30% rather than 10.


00:45:26.831 --> 00:45:28.746
- Who said that?
- No matter.


00:45:29.415 --> 00:45:32.582
But next time, I want 30
or I'll go elsewhere.


00:45:40.711 --> 00:45:41.835
Mr Vito,


00:45:42.212 --> 00:45:45.962
you wouldn't take advantage
of a penniless old lady?


00:45:47.839 --> 00:45:49.546
