- 30.


00:46:07.305 --> 00:46:09.638
- Can I help you?
- I want a TV.


00:46:09.764 --> 00:46:12.137
Of course. What do you want?


00:46:12.305 --> 00:46:14.430
A 20 or 30 inch screen?


00:46:16.807 --> 00:46:18.350
That one?


00:46:19.684 --> 00:46:23.435
That one is the Ferrari of TVs.


00:46:23.686 --> 00:46:27.643
60 inches, full HD,
progressive double-scan...


00:46:28.229 --> 00:46:31.396
3D, of course,
but it's not for you.


00:46:31.564 --> 00:46:32.729
What's 3D?


00:46:36.565 --> 00:46:37.732
I want that one.


00:46:40.066 --> 00:46:41.317
See the price?


00:46:41.900 --> 00:46:44.192
