00:47:25.877 --> 00:47:27.333
A dozen Afghan cookies.


00:47:27.502 --> 00:47:29.960
And space cakes.


00:47:33.755 --> 00:47:35.755
Rachid, why do you do that?


00:47:35.923 --> 00:47:37.755
They'll only deal with you.


00:47:37.922 --> 00:47:40.047
The others are real jealous.


00:47:40.257 --> 00:47:41.798
Pierrot's up to something.


00:47:42.383 --> 00:47:43.964
Be careful, lady.


00:47:51.052 --> 00:47:52.593
I'll tell you something.


00:47:52.969 --> 00:47:54.177
These jerks thought


00:47:54.511 --> 00:47:56.262
