00:47:57.304 --> 00:47:58.554
She's not straight.


00:47:58.680 --> 00:48:01.472
Shut up, Pierrot!
You don't bring in this much.


00:48:01.641 --> 00:48:03.222
- And you...
- My jacket!


00:48:03.474 --> 00:48:07.058
Keep cheating at Infamous 2
and I'll smash your fingers.


00:48:07.684 --> 00:48:08.892
Want a drink?


00:48:09.060 --> 00:48:11.184
No, Mr Vito, I'm not thirsty.


00:48:15.855 --> 00:48:17.979
4 kilos this time. OK?


00:48:18.314 --> 00:48:20.687
What?
Is someone bothering you?


00:48:20.813 --> 00:48:22.522
I'll waste him!


00:48:22.691 --> 00:48:24.064
Chill out.


00:48:25.817 --> 00:48:27.024
Calm down.


00:48:27.234 --> 00:48:28.942
- That's not it.
- What, then?


00:48:30.735 --> 00:48:31.943
I'm tired.


00:48:32.487 --> 00:48:34.068
You should've said.


00:48:34.903 --> 00:48:36.694
Momo, take it to her place.


00:49:23.881 --> 00:49:25.088
C'mon, sit down.


00:49:25.298 --> 00:49:26.881
What's this, bro?


00:49:27.465 --> 00:49:29.048
What does she want?


00:49:29.259 --> 00:49:32.215
