She wants to offer us a deal.


00:49:32.384 --> 00:49:34.091
What deal?


00:49:34.301 --> 00:49:36.134
You'll see. Sit down.


00:49:51.016 --> 00:49:51.974
Not for me.


00:49:55.144 --> 00:49:57.100
Help yourselves. It's oven fresh.


00:50:04.938 --> 00:50:07.771
There's enough work for everyone.


00:50:08.315 --> 00:50:10.731
I just bake the cakes.


00:50:11.232 --> 00:50:14.816
