for every customer you bring me.


00:50:16.776 --> 00:50:17.983
We're all happy.


00:50:18.734 --> 00:50:20.692
Wow, this is so good!


00:50:20.820 --> 00:50:21.695
Shut up, you!


00:50:22.985 --> 00:50:25.235
Don't talk to me like that.


00:50:25.405 --> 00:50:26.736
It is good.


00:50:27.655 --> 00:50:29.654
Just 'cause we don't bake cakes...


00:50:30.989 --> 00:50:32.614
This is a great idea.


00:50:32.823 --> 00:50:34.114
We're getting screwed.


00:50:34.824 --> 00:50:36.908
Guys who eat space cakes


00:50:37.075 --> 00:50:38.241
