you want to smoke.


00:50:40.952 --> 00:50:43.743
And when you smoke,
you want to eat.


00:50:54.540 --> 00:50:55.997
15%.


00:51:04.502 --> 00:51:05.085
OK.


00:51:18.633 --> 00:51:21.258
It busts my balls!
I can't even get past.


00:51:45.645 --> 00:51:48.144
It's cool, you get stoned
at your age.


00:51:49.062 --> 00:51:50.270
My buddy says:


00:51:50.688 --> 00:51:52.269
