00:53:16.429 --> 00:53:18.803
We'll find someone else
to play cards.


00:53:18.971 --> 00:53:20.472
Come on, Renée.


00:53:20.638 --> 00:53:22.805
Don't go. You're my only friends.


00:53:23.473 --> 00:53:25.723
Very well. Spit it out.


00:53:28.933 --> 00:53:31.100
Remember the cake I baked for you?


00:53:32.058 --> 00:53:33.184
Yes.


00:53:33.809 --> 00:53:35.477
