00:53:38.061 --> 00:53:39.812
Yes, hashish!


00:53:39.980 --> 00:53:41.647
You know, ganja, cannabis!


00:53:42.564 --> 00:53:43.980
Drugs!


00:53:45.148 --> 00:53:47.981
