but I'd had enough of being broke.


00:53:51.984 --> 00:53:55.484
That's great. You're so right!


00:53:56.194 --> 00:53:58.027
Sheer genius!


00:53:58.404 --> 00:54:00.445
Work more, earn more!


00:54:00.612 --> 00:54:03.112
But I don't touch hard drugs.


00:54:03.320 --> 00:54:04.530
Of course not.


00:54:04.780 --> 00:54:05.906
Hurry up.


00:54:06.531 --> 00:54:07.614
