00:54:26.166 --> 00:54:27.956
Afghan cookies...


00:54:29.957 --> 00:54:31.082
Paris Marrakesh.


00:54:32.792 --> 00:54:34.626
Ganja sponge fingers.


00:54:35.210 --> 00:54:37.835
Granny Junkie meringue.


00:54:45.964 --> 00:54:47.380
