00:54:47.549 --> 00:54:49.882
Even the bums have stopped drinking.


00:54:51.383 --> 00:54:54.134
'Scuse me, dude.
Where's Paulette's crib?


00:54:55.592 --> 00:54:56.841
I don't understand.


00:54:59.594 --> 00:55:00.968
What did she say?


00:56:02.410 --> 00:56:04.660
I'm coming. Come in...


00:56:04.829 --> 00:56:06.078
Hi, Paulette.


00:56:06.246 --> 00:56:09.578
We've just dropped in
to say hello.


00:56:11.037 --> 00:56:13.121
- Are you busy?
- No.


00:56:13.288 --> 00:56:15.206
Bye, Paulette. Bye, guys.


00:56:15.707 --> 00:56:17.082
By the way, will you...


00:56:17.248 --> 00:56:18.999
Yes, goodbye.


00:56:19.250 --> 00:56:22.792
Wow, your little business
is doing really well.


00:56:23.000 --> 00:56:24.874
