00:57:02.100 --> 00:57:04.849
Well, Agnès is having black thoughts.


00:57:05.641 --> 00:57:07.141
You can't blame her!


00:57:08.311 --> 00:57:09.601
Things are tense.


00:57:09.768 --> 00:57:11.519
It's bad for Léo.


00:57:13.606 --> 00:57:14.938
