00:57:15.106 --> 00:57:18.064
Yes, we're coming, we're coming!


00:57:19.107 --> 00:57:20.231
Hi.


00:57:20.441 --> 00:57:22.232
Granny, got any space...


00:57:22.441 --> 00:57:25.066
Meet Osama and his colleague.
They're cops.


00:57:26.067 --> 00:57:28.568
