00:57:32.653 --> 00:57:33.903
How's it going?


00:57:34.946 --> 00:57:38.905
It's like the dealers
are on vacation. Right, Ousmane?


00:57:50.035 --> 00:57:52.202
What the hell are they doing here?


00:57:52.453 --> 00:57:55.954
Idriss and Momo, such nice boys.
They run errands.


00:57:56.122 --> 00:57:58.163
I'll fuckin' waste 'em!


00:57:58.498 --> 00:58:00.080
It's my mother-in-law's.


00:58:04.791 --> 00:58:05.624
Hands up!


00:58:07.459 --> 00:58:09.208
Is Miss Paulette not in?


00:58:10.710 --> 00:58:12.334
You're crazy!


00:58:14.003 --> 00:58:15.753
Do forgive us, sir.


00:58:16.795 --> 00:58:18.754
I wanted to invite her to dinner.


00:58:18.963 --> 00:58:21.671
Mr Walter,
Paulette will be delighted.


00:58:22.131 --> 00:58:23.132
Right?


00:58:23.965 --> 00:58:26.089
- When?
- In 1 hour.


00:58:26.259 --> 00:58:29.798
Now, gentlemen,
Paulette has to get ready.


00:58:29.925 --> 00:58:32.466
Yes, of course. We won't keep you.


00:58:38.471 --> 00:58:39.262
Here?


00:58:39.471 --> 00:58:41.763
Yes. You know it?


00:58:43.639 --> 00:58:44.971
Come on, Paulette.


00:58:47.348 --> 00:58:48.723
Good evening.


00:58:49.057 --> 00:58:52.224
