01:01:08.487 --> 01:01:11.404
God moves in mysterious ways.


01:01:11.987 --> 01:01:12.779
Think so?


01:01:12.948 --> 01:01:14.864
I'm sure of it.


01:01:14.989 --> 01:01:17.074
What will my Francis think?


01:01:17.240 --> 01:01:20.949
I think he'll be very pleased
