01:01:24.493 --> 01:01:25.785
Hallelujah!


01:01:26.993 --> 01:01:28.203
What about me?


01:01:34.830 --> 01:01:36.997
- How was the boat trip?
- Great.


01:01:39.082 --> 01:01:39.915
What's wrong?


01:01:40.834 --> 01:01:41.958
