01:01:49.878 --> 01:01:51.419
Or weekend breaks.


01:01:52.003 --> 01:01:54.754
My life is ugly and shitty.


01:01:54.922 --> 01:01:56.755
I keep fighting with Ousmane.


01:01:58.548 --> 01:01:59.672
Here.


01:01:59.924 --> 01:02:01.381
This might help.


01:02:01.923 --> 01:02:03.173
