01:02:13.304 --> 01:02:14.679
Never a gift!


01:02:15.138 --> 01:02:16.636
Now you remember him!


01:02:16.805 --> 01:02:18.013
Keep your damn cash!


01:02:18.139 --> 01:02:18.805
Agnès...


01:02:18.973 --> 01:02:20.847
Leave me alone!


01:02:35.605 --> 01:02:36.812
