01:02:49.442 --> 01:02:50.358
Shittin' me?


01:02:54.570 --> 01:02:57.985
I thought their breasts were bigger.


01:02:58.113 --> 01:02:59.695
Flat as boards!


01:02:59.863 --> 01:03:02.029
Yes? You're here?


01:03:03.239 --> 01:03:05.823
Mrs Paulette, please come with me.


01:03:06.240 --> 01:03:07.950
