01:03:08.075 --> 01:03:10.326
I'll be right there.


01:03:18.621 --> 01:03:20.371
- Hey, Paulette.
- Hi, Rachid.


01:03:22.789 --> 01:03:23.623
Hey, Paulette.


01:03:24.457 --> 01:03:25.332
Hello.


01:03:25.541 --> 01:03:26.874
Brown-noser!


01:03:29.084 --> 01:03:30.084
Paws off!


01:03:30.250 --> 01:03:31.291
Punch him, Paulette!


01:03:32.042 --> 01:03:33.668
She's clean, boss.


01:03:33.835 --> 01:03:35.378
Give him a right hook!


01:03:41.421 --> 01:03:44.298
Mr Taras, delighted to meet you.


01:03:47.090 --> 01:03:48.632
Who are the tarts?


01:03:48.800 --> 01:03:50.592
Whores or your friends?


01:04:02.929 --> 01:04:04.764
Cheers, Mr Taras.


01:04:14.934 --> 01:04:18.977
Sales have tripled in a month.
What's your secret?


01:04:19.104 --> 01:04:21.103
If I tell you,
it won't be a secret.


01:04:22.980 --> 01:04:25.271
But as Francis, my husband, said:


01:04:25.648 --> 01:04:26.980
