01:04:33.442 --> 01:04:35.484
Yeah, vary the menu.


01:04:36.235 --> 01:04:38.276
Why didn't you think of that?


01:04:39.985 --> 01:04:40.818
I dunno.


01:04:41.444 --> 01:04:43.153
Grandma, take his place.


01:04:43.904 --> 01:04:46.195
