01:04:51.783 --> 01:04:52.615
And me?


01:04:53.408 --> 01:04:54.490
You?


01:05:07.621 --> 01:05:10.954
Fuck me!
There's no signal in this shithole!


01:05:12.874 --> 01:05:14.831
Fuck and shit!


01:05:14.999 --> 01:05:17.165
# She told me to go up there


01:05:17.333 --> 01:05:18.918
