01:05:45.469 --> 01:05:47.804
heroin, cocaine... Another level!


01:05:47.970 --> 01:05:50.054
Imagine all the cash we can make!


01:05:50.596 --> 01:05:51.804
But, Mr Taras...


01:05:52.095 --> 01:05:54.429
What? Make 'em chocolate pastries.


01:05:54.640 --> 01:05:57.057
Kids love chocolate.
Start tomorrow.


01:06:22.859 --> 01:06:24.194
Why are you here?


01:06:25.402 --> 01:06:27.194
Who gave you this pastry?


01:06:27.362 --> 01:06:28.737
Mom did.


01:06:30.404 --> 01:06:33.070
My pal's going to the seaside
with his gran.


01:06:34.698 --> 01:06:36.863
Would you like to see the sea?


01:06:37.032 --> 01:06:38.489
You bet I would!


01:06:51.621 --> 01:06:56.495
Just one thing: Did the rental guy
say how many gears this has?


01:06:57.457 --> 01:06:58.915
6, he said.


01:06:59.083 --> 01:07:00.247
6?


01:07:02.208 --> 01:07:04.625
There's at least 2 I haven't found.


01:07:05.084 --> 01:07:06.750
Are you happy?


01:07:09.711 --> 01:07:11.045
How does it work?


01:07:11.170 --> 01:07:14.087
Try the red handle under the seat.


01:07:30.969 --> 01:07:32.259
The living area.


01:07:36.263 --> 01:07:37.887
The first bedroom.


01:07:41.973 --> 01:07:43.973
And here's the second bedroom.


01:07:56.311 --> 01:07:59.229
We wish you an excellent stay
in our hotel.


01:08:05.816 --> 01:08:08.108
We came here every summer.


01:08:09.318 --> 01:08:10.398
But...


01:08:11.275 --> 01:08:13.650
where's the house?


01:08:15.068 --> 01:08:16.903
We're too late, Alzheimer.


01:08:18.152 --> 01:08:19.487
Granny!


01:08:22.780 --> 01:08:24.321
Not too fast!


01:08:37.869 --> 01:08:40.201
Is this where you came with Mom?


01:08:40.371 --> 01:08:41.119
Beautiful.


01:08:42.287 --> 01:08:44.662
I'd forgotten how beautiful it was.


01:09:14.799 --> 01:09:16.049
No, Mom.


01:09:16.343 --> 01:09:19.136
I'd tell you,
but she's not being mean.


01:09:22.096 --> 01:09:23.845
Sure you won't be scared alone?


01:09:24.013 --> 01:09:25.846
No, he won't be scared.


01:09:26.305 --> 01:09:28.139
Why were you mean
for so long?


01:09:29.140 --> 01:09:31.058
You're not so mean, after all.


01:09:31.182 --> 01:09:33.016
Be careful, though!


01:09:34.017 --> 01:09:36.975
You know, if we're here,
it's thanks to you.


01:09:39.603 --> 01:09:42.185
I'll tell you when you're grown up.


01:09:49.898 --> 01:09:52.189
Mr Taras, I've thought it over.


01:09:52.524 --> 01:09:55.189
I want no part of your cake business.


01:09:55.608 --> 01:09:58.859
Why? Because I think it's wrong.


01:10:01.068 --> 01:10:03.860
Know what, Russky?
Screw you!


01:10:15.992 --> 01:10:18.490
How about a drive along the coast?


01:10:18.700 --> 01:10:19.700
Just us two.


01:10:19.867 --> 01:10:21.201
Scram.


01:10:26.037 --> 01:10:27.287
7, red, impair.


01:10:30.622 --> 01:10:33.205
You're very lucky!


01:10:33.330 --> 01:10:35.915
- What's your name?
- Alzheimer!


01:11:51.278 --> 01:11:53.360
Are you OK, my little Léo?


01:11:55.280 --> 01:11:57.278
It's time to go home.


01:12:22.166 --> 01:12:23.582
What happened?


01:12:28.000 --> 01:12:29.167
Francis...


01:12:53.136 --> 01:12:54.469
Problem, Mr Vito?


01:12:54.636 --> 01:12:56.594
There is a small problem.


01:12:58.180 --> 01:13:00.972
Taras hates it
when people say no to him.


01:13:02.349 --> 01:13:03.763
What'll you do?


01:13:03.932 --> 01:13:06.515
We'll burn your feet
with a blowtorch.


01:13:06.683 --> 01:13:09.349
Then, we'll cut you into little bits.


01:13:09.976 --> 01:13:12.141
- We have the kid.
- Little Léo!


01:13:12.268 --> 01:13:14.892
Now listen,
you do what Mr Taras wants.


01:13:15.060 --> 01:13:17.562
Or I'll turn the kid
into sausage meat!


01:13:17.855 --> 01:13:19.896
Please don't hurt him, Mr Vito.


01:13:20.064 --> 01:13:21.605
He's not involved.


01:13:27.273 --> 01:13:28.440
Her birthday?


01:13:28.609 --> 01:13:30.691
No, she took Léo to the seaside.


01:13:35.402 --> 01:13:37.818
I warn you, it's the police. Open up!


01:13:40.279 --> 01:13:43.654
If you don't open up,
I'll call a SWAT team!


01:13:45.901 --> 01:13:47.299
One...


01:13:51.329 --> 01:13:52.763
Paulette?


01:13:56.872 --> 01:13:58.188
Paulette?


01:14:01.121 --> 01:14:02.912
We have Léo, so shut up!


01:14:12.167 --> 01:14:13.290
Pardon me.


01:14:27.088 --> 01:14:28.463
- What happened?
- Nothing.


01:14:28.631 --> 01:14:31.048
- You've been burglarized!
- No.


01:14:31.215 --> 01:14:33.047
I'll get a patrol here now.


01:14:33.215 --> 01:14:35.508
No, Ousmane, there's no need.


01:14:35.675 --> 01:14:38.675
The wind just knocked over
a few trinkets.


01:14:38.885 --> 01:14:40.676
Hurricane Katrina, more like!


01:14:40.886 --> 01:14:42.093
It's fine, really.


01:14:42.261 --> 01:14:45.428
- Are you sure?
- Yes, thanks for coming over.


01:14:45.596 --> 01:14:48.678
I just have to tidy things up now.


01:14:52.055 --> 01:14:53.305
They're bluffing.


01:14:53.474 --> 01:14:54.640
Léo's tough.


01:14:54.850 --> 01:14:56.725
They mean business.


01:15:04.353 --> 01:15:05.811
Mom, open up!


01:15:07.270 --> 01:15:08.436
Is he here?


01:15:08.980 --> 01:15:10.062
- Who?
- He's not?


01:15:10.230 --> 01:15:12.230
- Who?
- Léo, dammit!


01:15:12.606 --> 01:15:16.440
He disappeared after school.
I thought he was here.


01:15:18.149 --> 01:15:19.608
Vito kidnapped him.


01:15:22.444 --> 01:15:24.361
Who's Vito?


01:15:24.528 --> 01:15:26.069
He supplies the drugs.


01:15:26.820 --> 01:15:29.447
We started dealing hash.


01:15:30.823 --> 01:15:33.864
That idiot Vito thought
we were screwing him.


01:15:34.157 --> 01:15:37.116
So, he kidnapped the kid
to blackmail Paulette.


01:15:37.992 --> 01:15:39.158
What?


01:15:41.661 --> 01:15:42.951
I'll call Ousmane.


01:15:43.285 --> 01:15:44.743
No, don't do that.


01:15:45.161 --> 01:15:47.452
They might hurt the kid.


01:15:50.413 --> 01:15:51.745
Who is it?


01:16:22.134 --> 01:16:23.217
Where's the kid?


01:16:23.675 --> 01:16:26.093
Or we'll bite your balls off!


01:16:36.638 --> 01:16:39.223
Momo, what're you playing at?


01:16:46.060 --> 01:16:48.434
What's going on?
What the hell is this?


01:16:48.601 --> 01:16:49.935
What're you doing?


01:16:54.438 --> 01:16:55.771
Don't point that at me.


01:16:55.979 --> 01:16:56.770
They're mean.


01:16:58.106 --> 01:17:00.190
- Not so smart now.
- Drop it.


01:17:00.357 --> 01:17:02.981
- Free the kid first.
- What?


01:17:03.150 --> 01:17:05.274
- It's not up for negotiation!
- What?


01:17:06.025 --> 01:17:07.608
"CSI: NY."


01:17:23.447 --> 01:17:24.406
Now what?


01:17:25.950 --> 01:17:29.158
Untie him!
I don't care if I die.


01:17:29.786 --> 01:17:31.116
- Untie him.
- Really?


01:17:31.285 --> 01:17:32.493
Just do it!


01:17:37.579 --> 01:17:38.495
Gran!


01:17:38.661 --> 01:17:40.911
Run along, kid.


01:17:52.167 --> 01:17:53.668
Where's Momo, dammit?


01:17:53.875 --> 01:17:55.751
I dunno.


01:18:00.213 --> 01:18:01.254
Yeah.


01:18:02.089 --> 01:18:03.379
OK, Taras.


01:18:04.297 --> 01:18:06.129
Granny, be reasonable.


01:18:06.799 --> 01:18:08.298
Mr Taras, never...


01:18:08.424 --> 01:18:11.592
Never will I make space cakes
for kids Léo's age.


01:18:12.176 --> 01:18:13.133
Vito.


01:18:13.301 --> 01:18:14.384
Yeah.


01:18:16.719 --> 01:18:18.219
OK, Taras.


01:18:20.178 --> 01:18:21.385
Idriss, the blowtorch.


01:18:21.554 --> 01:18:23.512
Oh, fuck, what a mess!


01:18:29.475 --> 01:18:31.225
What did you tell the cops?


01:18:31.893 --> 01:18:33.643
I wouldn't tell the police.


01:18:33.977 --> 01:18:35.642
And it's not my fault


01:18:35.811 --> 01:18:37.810
if my son-in-law's a cop.


01:18:38.104 --> 01:18:39.394
What is this shit?


01:18:39.644 --> 01:18:40.937
Stop!


01:18:59.527 --> 01:19:01.320
At the moment, my daughter


01:19:01.946 --> 01:19:04.112
is having relationship trouble.


01:19:05.155 --> 01:19:07.364
So he came over to discuss it.


01:19:07.490 --> 01:19:09.990
Never had relationship trouble?


01:19:11.116 --> 01:19:11.741
Shut up!


01:19:17.660 --> 01:19:18.701
Drop your gun!


01:19:20.828 --> 01:19:22.285
Don't move!


01:19:23.828 --> 01:19:25.537
Get going, you!


01:19:29.415 --> 01:19:31.288
I'll deal with him myself.


01:19:35.041 --> 01:19:37.666
I suspected
when I saw your apartment.


01:19:41.044 --> 01:19:43.754
Do you know about the cakes?


01:19:46.629 --> 01:19:48.170
What cakes?


01:19:51.922 --> 01:19:53.297
Vito says you're dealers.


01:19:53.966 --> 01:19:55.341
He has proof.


01:19:57.175 --> 01:19:58.341
Is that true?


01:20:08.429 --> 01:20:11.346
I know, Francis, I shouldn't have.


01:20:11.680 --> 01:20:14.139
You've been gone 10 years now.


01:20:14.681 --> 01:20:19.015
How can I get by
on 600 euros a month? How?


01:20:24.560 --> 01:20:27.311
I'll miss the kid.


01:20:28.978 --> 01:20:31.103
I grew fond of him.


01:20:35.523 --> 01:20:36.856
Free Paulette!


01:20:37.066 --> 01:20:40.275
Free Paulette! Free Paulette!


01:20:46.193 --> 01:20:48.027
Paulette equals Bob Marley


01:20:49.154 --> 01:20:50.653
In view of their age,


01:20:50.820 --> 01:20:52.987
Paulette and her accomplices


01:20:53.698 --> 01:20:57.155
were given suspended sentences.


01:20:57.323 --> 01:20:59.280
As you can see, the verdict


01:20:59.448 --> 01:21:02.532
was hailed as a victory
by their supporters


01:21:02.700 --> 01:21:04.617
who have now calmed down.


01:21:06.452 --> 01:21:08.410
What'll we do
without the hash?


01:21:08.537 --> 01:21:11.577
No more vacations,
shopping, and restaurants.


01:21:12.037 --> 01:21:14.203
We had fun while it lasted.


01:21:15.247 --> 01:21:17.539
Don't worry. I have a plan.


01:21:32.129 --> 01:21:34.337
I don't understand a word of this.


01:21:42.090 --> 01:21:43.174
Hello, Renée.


01:21:43.341 --> 01:21:45.175
- Good trip?
- Great.


01:21:45.342 --> 01:21:46.967
It's good to see you.


01:21:51.304 --> 01:21:52.718
Hi, Lucienne.


01:21:55.304 --> 01:21:56.762
Hello, Walter.


01:21:56.971 --> 01:21:58.345
Hi, fella.


01:21:59.807 --> 01:22:01.140
Hi, Maria.


01:22:07.517 --> 01:22:10.517
Those little bars in the tea box...


01:22:10.686 --> 01:22:12.685
I didn't tell Mom.


01:22:56.420 --> 01:23:04.323
Subtitling: ECLAIR GROUP - PARIS

